# Dev-only test harness artifacts (never shipped by Pages).
test/node_modules/
test/screenshots/
test/package-lock.json
# Throwaway analysis/capture scripts (dev tooling, not shipped).
scratchpad/
# Agent git worktrees. The Agent tool creates a full repo checkout per background
# agent here and removes it when the agent finishes, so these are transient copies
# of the repository itself — tens of megabytes of duplicate, and committing them
# would nest the repo inside itself. Scoped to `worktrees/` rather than `.claude/`
# so genuine tracked content there (skills, settings) is still possible.
.claude/worktrees/
